  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.07 Municipal assessing officials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.07 “Municipal assessing officials” means assessing officials as defined in RSA 79:1, I, namely “those charged by law with the duty of assessing taxes in the city, town or unincorporated place.”\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24 (formerly Rev 3401.08)",
